reconciliation alone completes the owed review from durable Gerrit + SQLite state.\"\nfault_injection: \"Process loss is injected at the proven seam immediately after HTTP acceptance and before dequeue by discarding the old asyncio queue; the external boundary is a stateful fake whose reset appends the production-observed comment-added shape after the persisted cursor.\"\n```\n\nThe final RED oracle will be held out from the fixer. Collection/execution proof, GREEN, defect-seeded mutation, broader gates, and the original restart reproduction will be recorded after the repair."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786356596521497001,"uuid":"a5e0c647-cf77-4aa9-80cf-13c83a49f575"}